From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gert Pellin <gert@pellin.be>
Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 20:43:05 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Surface analysis: follow the coding guideline

One class per file (CSurfaceDbSet, CSurfaceBar), k-prefixed constants,
explicit constructors, Qt integer types, markup kept out of tr(), no
throwing static initializers, clang-tidy findings fixed. The Durbuy
comparison test takes its data from environment variables only, and the
reference implementation the test data was generated with is included.
